摄影级质感，柔和室内光，浅景深，细节锐利，材质清晰（裙身缎面微高光，欧根纱领口半透，水晶首饰折光）。\n比例：9:16 | 版本 LH-001_畅颜_v1.0_手办图\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [410, 500], "pos": [620, 480], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "ds": {"offset": [-626.1922289930076, -357.4599730501121], "scale": 0.8769226950000027}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "image 2.5图生图", "bounding": [600, 400, 1350, 600]}], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 1, 11, "STRING"], [2, 3, 0, 1, 0, "IMAGE"], [3, 1, 0, 4, 0, "IMAGE"], [5, 8, 0, 9, 0, "MODEL"], [6, 9, 0, 10, 0, "MODEL"], [7, 10, 0, 11, 0, "MODEL"], [8, 11, 0, 12, 0, "MODEL"], [9, 12, 0, 13, 0, "MODEL"], [10, 13, 0, 14, 0, "MODEL"], [11, 14, 0, 15, 0, "MODEL"], [12, 15, 0, 16, 0, "MODEL"], [13, 16, 0, 17, 0, "MODEL"], [14, 17, 0, 18, 0, "MODEL"], [15, 18, 0, 19, 0, "MODEL"], [16, 19, 0, 20, 0, "MODEL"], [17, 20, 0, 21, 0, "MODEL"], [18, 21, 0, 22, 0, "MODEL"], [19, 22, 0, 23, 0, "MODEL"], [20, 23, 0, 24, 0, "MODEL"], [21, 24, 0, 25, 0, "MODEL"], [22, 29, 0, 25, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [23, 28, 0, 25, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [24, 26, 0, 25, 3, "LATENT"], [25, 31, 0, 30, 0, "*"], [26, 25, 0, 31, 0, "LATENT"], [27, 33, 0, 31, 1, "VAE"], [28, 32, 0, 28, 0, "CLIP"], [29, 32, 0, 29, 0, "CLIP"], [30, 27, 0, 29, 1, "STRING"]], "id": "3db41e2c-5fa8-4533-87c3-7a16d058abe4", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 37, "revision": 0}